direction: down
trigger: Bug report
memory: OPS_LOG.md
h1: Hypothesis A
h2: Hypothesis B
h3: Hypothesis C
gate: Test gate
pr: PR + human merge
trigger -> memory: read history
memory -> h1: worktree
memory -> h2: worktree
memory -> h3: worktree
h1 -> gate: disproved
h2 -> gate: failing test + fix
h3 -> gate: disproved
gate -> pr: passes
pr -> memory: append verdict
